nn's performance. Source: https://lauramccullagh.com/blog/2015/02/beast-bardo-exclusive-acoustic-launch-at-the-cape-town-club/"],
  ["29 Mar 2015","Live Review","BEAST at Park Acoustics, Pretoria","Running Wolf's Rant — Coverage of Park Acoustics in Pretoria praises BEAST's heavy twin-bass attack, Beckmann's piercing vocals and the drummer's performance, providing a useful record of the band's Gauteng live activity.","Coverage of Park Acoustics in Pretoria praises BEAST's heavy twin-bass attack, Beckmann's piercing vocals and the drummer's performance, providing a useful record of the band's Gauteng live activity. Source: https://rwrant.co.za/3rd-edition-of-park-acoustics-for-2015/"],
  ["09 Apr 2015","Feature / Album Review","Could this be SA's finest live rock act?","Mail & Guardian — A major national feature examines the making of Bardo, BEAST's experimental origins and its formidable live reputation. It explains how Zietsman and Nel began the project in a shared-house basement and discusses Zietsman's role mixing the second album.","A major national feature examines the making of Bardo, BEAST's experimental origins and its formidable live reputation. It explains how Zietsman and Nel began the project in a shared-house basement and discusses Zietsman's role mixing the second album. Source: https://mg.co.za/friday/2015-04-09-could-this-be-sa-s-finest-live-rock-act/"]
]
